  "details": "It would be really nice if we had built in pose libraries with many poses to choose from to override the default crouch and prone animations.\n\nIf we could set the poses to always apply everytime we press the crouch and prone to individual avatars, that would be a nice addition to the social experience.\n\nThe initial problem that these cannot be applied to non humanoid avatars can be addressed by detecting the action when users uncheck the humanoid box while creating avatars in unity.",
